{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1d89bbbf54264faf5d0a63826891da9ea99ee0814c8ad51d6dace9d982deb75c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d6db60037d9b7f9e7a34121d717be1918c11c9b8497dfce8c84ec5d22f1f298",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n我是为了向方才的事道谢，才联系您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:353e117e7bc8c52ab613b6a6ce32db9923683a1021b5e619b18d8694d99286bf",
      "text": "今天，真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6813bc10a2557a9e85f0728579e958c1f345982aa1584f08523add13495cb18b",
      "text": "能让您感到高兴\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466d4959548137eca7373eff2891cfedfc5e9e05b278c478666ce437fdd3470b",
      "text": "度过了一段愉快的时光呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2564c616aa985db350810c2997a793ac91c46498ae96a24ffbe7a3b895c5d5c",
      "text": "是的。能够和制作人慢慢地\n说上话，我也深表感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6013c4f50e239181acd6683c475480d714885c835a3eb30c88ce183d65d26e7",
      "text": "我听雨彦说了，蛋糕是制作人\n特意订制的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0ecd6fd38b3d93ba46d49e6bb749d84a425a183752c21e1671b610a9bdfa027",
      "text": "那个用果冻所表现的海洋，\n和我今天清晨所见的大海一样美丽动人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2075368c7a37227e73602a0b97f93e2491f33f51bffeaf8a263b2cf7507d2ce4",
      "text": "说到大海，今早我潜入海中的时候，\n发现了一样罕见的东西。那在以往这个时节里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab861f292272a1cff74f5da466b93a6eed1667587bb0a98878881ee133861119",
      "text": "……十分抱歉，制作人。\n请稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a5bd7b105995d274bc76c681b715680cdf977d82ad59dd1677d69b3b8337407",
      "text": "……好的，我明白了。马上就来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:165fedf88b77aa46ab726d67cc758a7f9c4cd4f922ffc9ddf8701639b1ebd6d5",
      "text": "失礼了。方才是家人在呼唤我。\n现在准备用晚餐了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b52cfd77428ca7eb92e09727bbab7671a356b391208028a0e84a7adb62ce1da4",
      "text": "明天请务必让我\n听听后续！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_22_t01:1_2_046_22_t01:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee0d73422548765465a0d23bb81d206be80bfbee436700b0fa7f5cf5e0e32fe",
      "text": "好的。那么这番话的后续就留到明天。\n今天真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
